{"steam_appid":2774040,"steam_name":"The Boss Gangster: Criminal Empire","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2774040/267947146/796546f8e23a3879f40c2770cf5438703e9cbb39/1793096476/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1793098451","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257480432/f3b26007bb6718734b34d346b959be78a9124442/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1793098451","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/97a501b9de9e2a0263d853a9e292dd442bf96d79/ss_97a501b9de9e2a0263d853a9e292dd442bf96d79.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793214837","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/2a9091344b56bbb8c73e85435af7fca196b5efb3/ss_2a9091344b56bbb8c73e85435af7fca196b5efb3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793214837","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/0cca376353a13f19eb91e6f369e7a7e9e10739d4/ss_0cca376353a13f19eb91e6f369e7a7e9e10739d4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793214837","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/2c843447c75de5f7045bc4bdfda379f33e1a1ce8/ss_2c843447c75de5f7045bc4bdfda379f33e1a1ce8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793214837","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/0e7b884aa2b2cda8afde048eb17431764b6c7d4f/ss_0e7b884aa2b2cda8afde048eb17431764b6c7d4f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793214837"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/4d910d66db0333b50a727c2d38c092b3.avif?t=1793214837\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras_big/4d910d66db0333b50a727c2d38c092b3.webp?t=1793214837 width=1560 height=661 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>This is an open-world criminal empire simulator.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/a6a3c9e99cf88ae002efe0b8a8536e3d.poster.avif?t=1793214837\" width=770 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/a6a3c9e99cf88ae002efe0b8a8536e3d.webm?t=1793214837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/a6a3c9e99cf88ae002efe0b8a8536e3d.mp4?t=1793214837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Criminal Empire From the Streets Up.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal cars, run illegal businesses, recruit your own crime family and conquer the city in a seamless open-world criminal empire simulator. Every crime, business and territory is connected, allowing you to build your organization from a small-time hustler into the city's most powerful kingpin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/291054ae68654fd0b5adb6b03bff5efd.poster.avif?t=1793214837\" width=770 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/291054ae68654fd0b5adb6b03bff5efd.webm?t=1793214837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/291054ae68654fd0b5adb6b03bff5efd.mp4?t=1793214837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A True Criminal Playground</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how your empire begins. Become a car thief, drug producer, nightclub owner, dealer or crime boss. Every path leads to the same goal: control the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/8ba84da32037ded6daff86f91b6a222f.poster.avif?t=1793214837\" width=770 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/8ba84da32037ded6daff86f91b6a222f.webm?t=1793214837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/8ba84da32037ded6daff86f91b6a222f.mp4?t=1793214837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Criminal Empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Commit Crimes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal Cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pickpocket</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade the Police</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shootouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Street Races</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/d74969004cd1edfbe5e2d05b6e7f1822.poster.avif?t=1793214837\" width=770 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/d74969004cd1edfbe5e2d05b6e7f1822.webm?t=1793214837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/d74969004cd1edfbe5e2d05b6e7f1822.mp4?t=1793214837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run Illegal Businesses</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warehouse Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightclub Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Production Chains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Business Automation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Office Operations &amp; Criminal Jobs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rent cheap motel rooms or apartments to start your first illegal operation, then expand into warehouses, businesses, and a city-wide criminal network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow from a small-time hustler into the city's most powerful crime boss.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/5a62ca9b32dcc8ff7a3f3e060a6a61de.poster.avif?t=1793214837\" width=770 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/5a62ca9b32dcc8ff7a3f3e060a6a61de.webm?t=1793214837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/5a62ca9b32dcc8ff7a3f3e060a6a61de.mp4?t=1793214837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rule The City</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rival Families</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Territory Control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit Gangsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand Your Influence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become The Boss</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/bb7c60d40a28bab5f56250ef12fbcab8.poster.avif?t=1793214837\" width=770 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/bb7c60d40a28bab5f56250ef12fbcab8.webm?t=1793214837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/bb7c60d40a28bab5f56250ef12fbcab8.mp4?t=1793214837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Build Your Criminal Empire: Start with nothing and rise from a small-time hustler to the city's most powerful crime boss.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Commit Crimes Your Way: Steal cars, pickpocket civilians, rob targets, evade the police, and complete criminal jobs across the city.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Run Illegal Businesses: Build warehouses, manage nightclubs, automate production chains, and expand your criminal network.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Recruit Your Crime Family: Hire gangsters, assign criminal operations, eliminate rival families, and take control of every district.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Conquer the City: Fight for control of 11 unique districts, eliminate rival families, earn Prestige, and dominate the city’s criminal underworld.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Living Open World: NPCs, police, traffic, businesses, and rival organizations react dynamically to your actions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Vehicle Theft &amp; Customization: Steal, customize, upgrade, race, or dismantle vehicles for profit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Deep Progression System: Unlock skills, improve your abilities, expand your businesses, and discover new ways to build your empire.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Every System is Connected: Crimes, businesses, territories, economy, and progression work together to create one seamless criminal empire simulation.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/ff4d0916b9c1a7c5040aac684b847872.avif?t=1793214837\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras_big/ff4d0916b9c1a7c5040aac684b847872.webp?t=1793214837 width=1560 height=521 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 Home 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5  AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5000 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 Home 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7 AMD Ryzen 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA Geforce RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5000 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie","RPG","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["BEF GAMES"],"publishers":["Tripwire Presents"],"release_date":"Oct 27, 2026"}